Title: Marry Me by Friday
Episode: 3 - Clean Your Own Office
Format: Live-action, cinematic vertical micro drama, 9:16, about 85 seconds
Draft date: 2026-10-19

INT. HALCYON TOWER - BOARDROOM - CONTINUOUS

[[HOOK: Mia slides the ring box back to Vivian.]]

Mia slides the velvet ring box back across the white table, all the way to Vivian.

MIA
No.

VIVIAN
You haven't met him.

The doors open. GRANT BLAKE (31, navy velvet blazer, tousled sandy hair, a dimple in one cheek) strolls in with a bouquet of white roses and drops to one knee beside Mia's chair.

GRANT
Relax. I'm the nice Blake.

A board member hides a laugh behind her hand. By the window, Damien watches, arms folded.

GRANT (CONT'D)
Marry me, Mia. We'll be very rich and very bored.

[[PAYOFF: the cleaner refuses the heir in front of the whole board.]]

Mia takes one rose from the bouquet and tucks it into his blazer pocket.

MIA
I'd rather marry the mop.

The table erupts. Grant's smile stays on, but his eyes go flat.

VIVIAN
(too calm)
Friday, Miss Calloway.

Vivian rises and walks out. Grant follows her. The board files out after them.

[[TWIST: Mia overhears that Vivian's first vote will remove Damien. Her enemy is trapped too.]]

Through the open door comes Vivian's voice from the corridor.

VIVIAN (O.S.)
The moment she's family, my first vote removes Damien.

Mia turns. At the window, Damien's jaw is set. He heard it too.

Mia's hand moves to her apron pocket, to a worn notebook with a photo of Vivian clipped to its cover.

INT. HALCYON TOWER - CEO OFFICE - NIGHT

The skyline glitters behind the glass. Damien sits alone at the walnut desk with a glass of whiskey, collar open.

A cleaning cart rolls in. Mia pushes it, back in her grey uniform.

DAMIEN
You quit.

MIA
I came for my mop.

DAMIEN
You heard her.

MIA
Every word.

DAMIEN
Then you know she wins either way.

Mia takes one typed page from the cart and sets it on his desk, squared with the edge.

[[CLIFFHANGER - offer: Mia proposes to the man who threw money at her.]]

MIA
Marry me by Friday, Mr. Blake.

Damien looks up from the page to her.

MIA (CONT'D)
Or clean your own office.

CLOSE ON DAMIEN

The whiskey glass stops halfway to his mouth.

CUT TO BLACK.
